    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d179-a11">

                <pb facs="0331" n="325" sameAs="frus:frus1901China/pg325"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Annex No</hi>. 9.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" when="1901-06-18"
                            >June 18, 1901</date>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">IMPERIAL EDICT of 18th of June,
                        1901</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Translation</hi>).</p>
                <p>Edict received by telegraph from Hsi-an-Fu the 3d day of the 5th moon (18th of
                    June, 1901):</p>
                <p>We confer on <hi rendition="#small-caps">Na-Tung</hi>, second Vice-President of
                    the Board of Finances, the official button of the first rank, and we designate
                    him as special Envoy to go to Japan and to there respectfully discharge the
                    mission We entrust to him.</p>
                <p>Respect this!</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#italic">Correct copy</hi>. <lb/><signed><list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. d’Anthouard.</hi></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">B. Kroupensky.</hi></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reginald Tower</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">G. Bohlen-Halbach</hi>.</item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
